error: 'Buffer__i64' has both a concrete and a blanket 'impl Series' — which one applies is not stated by either
  --> examples/diagnostics/2030-diagnostics-impl-overlap.sx:13:1
   |
13 | impl Series($T) for Buffer($T) {
   | ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
14 |     count :: (self: *Buffer) -> i64 { self.n }
   | ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
15 | }
   | ^

help: drop one of them: a blanket impl covers every instantiation of its carrier, so a concrete impl for the same one is a second answer
   |
13 | impl Series($T) for Buffer($T) {
   | ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
14 |     count :: (self: *Buffer) -> i64 { self.n }
   | ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
15 | }
